## Latest Global EV Sales Figures for 2026

The most current comprehensive global electric vehicle data available covers the first half of 2026 through June, as full July figures are still being compiled by industry trackers. Global EV sales (including battery electric and plug-in hybrid vehicles) reached approximately **9.6 million units in H1 2026**, representing year-over-year growth of around **7%** according to the latest estimates. [1](#64591a58-1a87-42e3-ac86-1ccc1a0528c0)

### June 2026 Monthly Record

June 2026 marked a historic milestone, with global EV sales crossing **2.0 million units in a single month for the first time ever**. [2](#6f6384ef-39b3-45ba-978e-cea03087c83a) [1](#64591a58-1a87-42e3-ac86-1ccc1a0528c0) This represented an 11% increase over May 2026 and a 7% gain compared to June 2025. [1](#64591a58-1a87-42e3-ac86-1ccc1a0528c0)

